    "encoding_note": "PROFIBUS-DP uses RS-485 differential NRZ with an 11-bit UART character (1 start + 8 data + 1 even parity + 1 stop). Telegrams are selected by a Start Delimiter (SD1=0x10, SD2=0x68, SD3=0xA2, SD4=0xDC), with SC=0xE5 short ACK and ED=0x16, and protected by an 8-bit arithmetic-checksum FCS. PROFIBUS-PA uses Manchester encoding at 31.25 kbit/s."
